erver until its buffer runs out. The server then deletes the files to make space for the new files.","topics":[],"score":197090,"global_rank":318385},{"name":"Jacobinski/Code-Golf","owner":"Jacobinski","html_url":"https://github.com/Jacobinski/Code-Golf","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"\u26f3 A repository for Code Golf Practice","topics":[],"score":197090,"global_rank":318386}]